                                        <div class="tab-pane fade active show" id="pills-1" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Introduction"><p align="justify">The Student Registration Division (SRD) is responsible for planning, managing, and delivering all services related to student admission and registration at IGNOU. It serves as a single-window platform for learners to access information and complete processes such as fresh admission, re-registration, credit transfer, elective changes, study centre updates, and related services in a learner-friendly and technology-enabled manner. <br/>
<br/>
The Student Registration Division (SRD) of IGNOU is responsible for:<ul>
<li>developing policies and procedures for admission of learners into various academic programmes offered by the University;</li>
<li>managing the processes of admission, re-registration, credit transfer etc.;</li>
<li>maintaining the database of enrolled students and providing data/reports to various stakeholders;</li>
<li>providing information and guidance to the prospective learners; and</li>
<li>assessing equivalence of degrees awarded by other Universities/Institutions for the purpose of admission in academic programmes offered by the University.</li></ul>

</div>

                                        
                                    </div>
