<li>Centralised Student Registration Cell: 011-29571528</li>
<li>Email: csrc@ignou.ac.in</li></ul></p>
<br/>
<p><b>Other IGNOU Contacts:</b><ul>
<li>Official IGNOU address: Maidan Garhi, New Delhi-110068</li></ul></p>
</div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div>
                                        

                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Vision&amp;Mission"  ><b>Vision & Mission</b><br/>
<br/>
To provide efficient, transparent, and digital student registration services contributing to an enriching academic experience. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Mission</b>
<ul>
<li>To simplify admission and registration processes using state-of-the-art technology</li>
<li>To maintain accurate and up-to-date student records.</li>
<li>To offer easy access to registration details and support services for learners across India and abroad.</li></ul></div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div>
                                        

                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-4" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="CoreFunctions&amp;Activities"  >The key responsibilities for SRD:<ul>
<li>Formulate policies and procedures for admission to various programmes.</li>
<li>Manage online admission, re-registration, elective change, address change, and credit transfer.</li>
<li>Maintain the university’s student database and generate reports for internal and external stakeholders.</li>
<li>Assess equivalence of qualifications from other universities for IGNOU programme admission.</li>
<li>Enable Regional Centres to download scholar registers from the online system.</li></ul></p>
</div>
