                                        <div class="tab-pane fade" id="pills-9" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="Websitebasedstudentservices"  ><p align="justify">To strengthen student services, SRD provides online services at IGNOU website at the weblink 
<a href="http://admission.ignou.ac.in/changeadmdata/admissionstatusnew.asp"_blank"> http://admission.ignou.ac.in/changeadmdata/admissionstatusnew.asp</a> whereby learners can check their admission and re-registration details, change of elective course(s), address of the learner, credit transfer effected, study centre change and download prospectus for various programmes. For ready availability and convenience of IGNOU’s learners spread all over the country and abroad, SRD has incorporated validity period of admission in each student‘s registration in the database. Learners can view and check the status of their registration along with name and address details at the IGNOU website. Provision has been made for Regional Centres to download scholar register from the website itself.<br/>
<br/>
SRD has also uploaded on IGNOU website, Credit transfer scheme of various programmes with prescribed pro-forma; notifications issued pertaining to equivalence/recognition granted and the notifications/gazette publications by various regulatory bodies regarding recognition of IGNOU degrees, diplomas and certificates.</p></div>
