                                                                            <th>Brief Profile:</th>
                                                                            <td><p align ="justify">Dr. Shekhar Suman is currently serving as Deputy Director in the Student Registration Division (SRD) at IGNOU. In this role, he is associated with learner admission processes, registration systems, and compliance with regulatory frameworks in ODL.<br/>
